-------------------------------------------

School-site JSON files, timetable JSON files, period templates, and timetable
page source submitted for parsing are user-provided data, not bundled
third-party assets. They are handled according to the app's privacy policy and
are not covered by this notice file unless the user adds separate third-party
materials on their own.
